# Videos Directory

Place your hero video file here as `hero-video.mov`

The video will be accessible at `/videos/hero-video.mov` in your SvelteKit app.

## Current Video File:

- File name: `hero-video.mov`
- Location: `apps/noir-crafted/static/videos/hero-video.mov`
- URL: `/videos/hero-video.mov`

## Recommended Video Specs:

- Format: MOV or MP4 (H.264 codec recommended for web)
- Resolution: 1920x1080 or higher
- Frame rate: 24-30 fps
- File size: Keep under 10MB for web performance (consider compression)

## Note:

If you need to convert MOV to MP4 for better browser compatibility, you can use:

- FFmpeg: `ffmpeg -i hero-video.mov -c:v libx264 -c:a aac hero-video.mp4`
- Online converters or video editing software
